OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,FA Reform UK government would cut #50
OL,7,Fbillion from the welfare bill, with
OL,8,Falmost three million people seeing
OL,9,Ftheir disability and sickness payments
OL,10,Fwithdrawn or changed.
OL,12,FReform's Treasury spokesman Robert
OL,13,FJenrick said the plan would be the
OL,14,Fbiggest shake-up of the welfare state
OL,15,Fin a generation.
OL,17,FUnder the plans, Reform would abolish
OL,18,Fpersonal independence payments (Pip)
OL,19,Fand the health element of Universal
OL,20,FCredit for working-age adults, The
OL,21,FTelegraph reported.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
