OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,FJenrick said 6.9 million people were
OL,7,Freceiving disability benefits, but
OL,8,F"this is not an epidemic of broken
OL,9,Fbacks and lost limbs," as since 2002
OL,10,Fthe share of working-age people
OL,11,Fclaiming for mental health and
OL,12,Fbehavioural conditions had tripled.
OL,14,FUnder the planned reforms, due to be
OL,15,Funveiled in detail on Monday, a new,
OL,16,Fregularly-reviewed health security
OL,17,Fallowance would provide support for
OL,18,Fthe "gravely ill and severely
OL,19,Fchallenged", Jenrick said.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@VO]zD@EOU{D@KO]
