OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,FCash payments for low-level conditions
OL,7,Fwould end and be replaced with
OL,8,Fdisability support accounts, run by
OL,9,Flocal councils and mayors, to cover
OL,10,Fcosts such as equipment, adaptations,
OL,11,Ftransport, and personal assistance.
OL,13,FAnd employers could be obliged to pay
OL,14,Fa "return to work cover" insurance to
OL,15,Ffund the cost of the first two years
OL,16,Fafter an employee is signed off sick.
OL,18,FJenrick said firms would then have a
OL,19,F"strong economic incentive" to return
OL,20,Fthe employee to work.
OL,26,@vD@COUvD@XO]{D@AOU{D@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
