OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,FPeople who had not returned to work
OL,7,Fwithin two years would go through a
OL,8,Fsingle, rigorous assessment conducted
OL,9,Fin person to "screen out vexatious and
OL,10,Ffraudulent claims".
OL,12,FWriting in The Telegraph, Jenrick
OL,13,Fsaid: "We will not pretend this is
OL,14,Fpainless.
OL,26,@qD@NOUrD@RO]uD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
