PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,F"Existing claimants will be reassessed
OL,7,Fover three to four years: we estimate
OL,8,Fthat 2.16 million will keep their
OL,9,Fpresent cash entitlement in full,
OL,10,Fwhile 2.89 million will see theirs
OL,11,Fmodified or withdrawn, concentrated
OL,12,Fwhere recent growth has been most
OL,13,Fexplosive."
OL,15,FHe said the state must be there to
OL,16,Fsupport people who need it, but
OL,17,F"dumping our young people onto welfare
OL,18,Fisn't compassion; it's neglect".
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@KO]yD@AOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
