OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,F"We are not lifting people out of
OL,7,Fmisfortune. We are abandoning them to
OL,8,Fit, and calling it kindness."
OL,10,FJenrick said the Reform proposals
OL,11,Fwould save "more than double" the #23
OL,12,Fbillion promised by Kemi Badenoch's
OL,13,FConservatives, with #22 billion of the
OL,14,Fsavings coming from changes to
OL,15,Fdisability benefits alone.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@]O]sD@LOUsD@]O]
