OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,FShe said: "Reform have been nowhere on
OL,7,Fthe debate on welfare reform. They
OL,8,Fhave flip-flopped on restoring the two
OL,9,Fchild benefit cap and claimed they'll
OL,10,Fonly take benefits away from
OL,11,Fforeigners, which won't do enough to
OL,12,Fbring down the overall bill.
OL,14,F"The Conservatives are on the side of
OL,15,Fworking people and we're clear about
OL,16,Four plans. Restore the two-child
OL,17,Fbenefit cap, end benefits for low
OL,18,Flevel mental health conditions, remove
OL,19,Fbenefits from foreign nationals and
OL,20,Frestore face-to-face assessments."
OL,26,@nD@KOUvD@AOU|D@bO]
