OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786877293
OL,3,CReform UK vows to cut welfare system
OL,4,Cto save #50 billion
OL,6,FA Labour spokeswoman said: "Reform's
OL,7,F#50 billion claim is fantasy
OL,8,Feconomics, built on stripping support
OL,9,Ffrom disabled people and shifting
OL,10,Fcosts onto employers."
OL,12,FShe added that the Labour Government's
OL,13,Freforms to welfare "deliver credible,
OL,14,Findependently-costed savings, not
OL,15,Farbitrary numbers with no credible
OL,16,Fplan behind them".
